Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.31,0:00:36.34,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ABERTURA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:39.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Primeira curiosidade: a academia voltou, e
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.22,Legenda,,0,0,0,,muito mais detalhada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:43.67,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Num deck de madeira, bem na beira da água, dá
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:46.02,Legenda,,0,0,0,,para treinar com kettlebell, fazer supino e
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:47.34,Legenda,,0,0,0,,até levantamento terra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:50.13,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E o jogo mostra um contador de repetições na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:52.92,Legenda,,0,0,0,,tela, como se fosse um aplicativo de treino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:55.44,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Quem jogou San Andreas lembra que o personagem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.24,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ganhava músculo indo à academia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:01:00.02,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se o treino muda alguma coisa em GTA 6, a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:03.12,Legenda,,0,0,0,,gente ainda vai descobrir, mas a vista da baía
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:05.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,enquanto você puxa ferro já vale a visita.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.49,0:00:41.14,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.39,0:00:47.26,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
