Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.56,0:02:04.11,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}3. PEDÁGIO NA PONTE
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.71,0:01:45.31,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}PEDÁGIO
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.91,0:01:45.31,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}muito Flórida
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:06.94,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Quarta: dá para descer com o carro na areia,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:08.40,Legenda,,0,0,0,,bem na beira da água.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:11.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A picape perde velocidade, o pneu afunda e a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.37,0:02:13.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,direção fica mais pesada.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:15.98,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em GTA 5, a praia era quase só cenário.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui ela vira caminho, e já tem gente usando a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:21.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,areia para cortar trajeto e fugir do trânsito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:23.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E não é só a praia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:25.99,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na beira da água tem casa de madeira, deck e
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:28.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,garagem com barco guardado, aquele visual de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:30.81,Legenda,,0,0,0,,quem mora na costa da Flórida.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.26,0:02:13.02,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.27,0:02:15.90,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.15,0:02:21.72,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
