Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.68,0:03:06.28,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}PROCURADO
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.88,0:03:06.28,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}perseguição de cinema
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:39.90,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Sétima: o pátio de apreensão da polícia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:42.42,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tem um lugar inteiro com viaturas da polícia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:45.04,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de Leonida, guinchos e carros parados atrás da
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:45.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cerca.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:48.28,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em GTA 5, quando você perdia o carro, ele ia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:49.93,Legenda,,0,0,0,,parar num pátio parecido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:52.87,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tudo indica que a ideia continua aqui, agora
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:55.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,com muito mais detalhe e muito mais viatura.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.87,0:03:39.82,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.07,0:03:45.44,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
