Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.72,0:03:56.19,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}7. PÁTIO DA POLÍCIA
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.87,0:03:40.47,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}POLICE IMPOUND
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.07,0:03:40.47,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}pátio de apreensão
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:58.86,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Oitava: assistência na estrada.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:01.20,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aparece um guincho com o nome Roadside
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:03.47,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Assistance, o famoso socorro de carro
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:04.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,quebrado.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:06.26,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em Leonida até o trânsito tem gente
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.85,Legenda,,0,0,0,,trabalhando para resolver os problemas dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:11.28,Legenda,,0,0,0,,É o tipo de coisa que você não percebe na
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:13.99,Legenda,,0,0,0,,primeira volta, mas que deixa o mundo com cara
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:14.93,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de lugar real.
