Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.19,0:04:15.30,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}8. ASSISTÊNCIA NA ESTRADA
Dialogue: 2,0:03:59.03,0:04:02.63,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00D6E62E\shad6\4c&H40240612}ROADSIDE ASSISTANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:18.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nona: a oficina de pintura voltou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.33,0:04:20.64,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Dá para entrar com o carro e trocar a cor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:22.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,aquele clássico da série.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:24.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Serve para deixar o carro do seu jeito ou,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:26.79,Legenda,,0,0,0,,como manda a tradição de GTA, para tentar
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.81,0:04:28.00,Legenda,,0,0,0,,despistar a polícia.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.45,0:04:22.01,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.26,0:04:28.27,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
