Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.37,0:04:53.36,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}10. AMMU-NATION
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.52,0:04:32.12,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}AMMU-NATION
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:56.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Décima primeira: dá para entrar em lojas e
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:56.86,Legenda,,0,0,0,,bares.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:58.97,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Um dos bares na beira do mar se chama
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:01.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Pindayho, tem cardápio na parede e gente
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.27,0:05:02.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,sentada conversando.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:05.00,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Junta isso com o guarda-roupa para trocar de
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:07.64,Legenda,,0,0,0,,roupa e o celular do jogo, e você tem um mundo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.12,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pensado para viver, não só para atravessar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:12.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em GTA 5, a maior parte das lojas era só
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:13.53,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fachada.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:16.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em Leonida, a sensação é de que quase toda
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:17.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,porta pode abrir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:19.74,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E isso dá um motivo a mais para sair do carro
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:20.54,Legenda,,0,0,0,,e andar a pé.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.51,0:04:56.78,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.03,0:05:02.38,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
