Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.36,0:05:20.91,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}11. LOJAS E BARES
Dialogue: 2,0:04:57.03,0:05:00.63,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}PINDAYHO
Dialogue: 2,0:04:57.23,0:05:00.63,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}bar na beira do mar
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:24.44,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Décima segunda, e talvez a mais bonita: o pôr
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:25.18,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do sol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:27.78,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Rua com palmeira, céu roxo e laranja,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:30.64,Legenda,,0,0,0,,estacionamento com a luz baixa batendo no
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:31.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,asfalto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:34.51,Legenda,,0,0,0,,É exatamente aquele clima dos trailers, só que
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:37.08,Legenda,,0,0,0,,agora rodando no console, com você no
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:37.85,Legenda,,0,0,0,,controle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:41.06,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se você só quiser dirigir sem rumo no fim da
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:43.65,Legenda,,0,0,0,,tarde, GTA 6 já cumpriu a promessa.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.06,0:05:25.10,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.35,0:05:31.28,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
