Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.91,0:05:44.02,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}12. O PÔR DO SOL
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.06,0:05:24.66,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}PÔR DO SOL
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.26,0:05:24.66,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}o clima dos trailers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:44.17,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E isso é só o começo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:47.70,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nos próximos dias eu trago bugs, carros,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:51.47,Legenda,,0,0,0,,segredos e o tamanho real do mapa, tudo com
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.49,0:05:52.95,Legenda,,0,0,0,,imagem do jogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:55.72,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se inscreve, ativa o sininho e comenta aqui:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:58.26,Legenda,,0,0,0,,qual dessas curiosidades você vai testar
